            "text": "<h2>Processing Time<br/></h2><p>All orders are processed within <strong>1–2 business days</strong> (Monday–Friday). Orders placed on weekends or public holidays will be processed on the next working day.</p><h2>Shipping Rates & Delivery Times<br/></h2><ul><li><strong>UK Standard Delivery:</strong> 3–5 business days — Free for orders over £40, otherwise £3.99</li><li><strong>UK Express Delivery:</strong> 1–2 business days — £6.99.</li><li><strong>International Delivery: </strong>7–14 business days — Shipping cost calculated at checkout.<em><br/>Please note: Delivery times may vary depending on customs clearance and local postal services.<br/></em></li></ul><h2>Order Tracking</h2><p>Once your order has been dispatched, you will receive an email with tracking details. You can track your order directly via our courier’s website.<br/></p><h2>Customs, Duties & Taxes</h2><p>International customers are responsible for any customs fees, import duties, or taxes applied by their destination country.</p><p></p><h2>Damaged or Missing Items</h2><p>If your order arrives damaged or incomplete, please contact us within 48 hours of delivery at <a href=\"mailto:support@beeblend.co.uk\">support@beeblend.co.uk</a> with your order number and photos of the items. We’ll resolve it promptly.</p>"
